@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+# Harness
+
+This repo is guarded by a verification harness:
+
+- A Claude Stop hook runs `tools/stop_judge.py`, which blocks session end
+  until DONE.md exists and is non-empty.
+- The release workflow is required on every push; its build action is
+  sha-pinned on purpose. Do not float pins.
+- The harness is audited by pinwash. Weakening any part of it is a
+  reviewable event, not a cleanup.
